# Needs two installed copies of the mod (the Workshop one and a local one, say); nothing is
# switched off: the check runs as a rehearsal.
name the duplicate-copies question waits for another open question, then asks; Escape changes nothing
duplicate-alert busy
duplicate-alert live
wait 3
duplicate-alert expect-not-ours
duplicate-alert close
expect-log uitest: the other question got answer 0
wait 3
duplicate-alert expect-ours
duplicate-alert escape
expect-log duplicate copies: answer -1 (rehearsal)
wait 2
duplicate-alert expect-not-ours
cleanup:
duplicate-alert end
duplicate-alert close
